h Roller that enables the operator to set the tine depth to precise shallow depths.</li></ul><a href="/collections/bcs-tractor-attachments?filter.p.product_type=Rear-Tine+Tiller" target="_self" data-pf-type="Button2" class="sc-brPMkR hVSHHp pf-100_ pf-button-2">Shop Rear-Tine Tillers</a></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-eBHgEO bnCcLn pf-102_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/BCS-TillingWithPDR_500x.jpg?v=1693515598" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/BCS-TillingWithPDR.jpg?v=1693515598 1536w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/BCS-TillingWithPDR_500x.jpg?v=1693515598 320w" width="4032" height="3024" sizes="(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, (min-width: 1024px) 1280px, (min-width: 640px) 768px, calc(100vw/3)" loading="lazy" data-pf-type="Image3" class="sc-kWtorq hnOOBS pf-103_ pf-image-1"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-8f22" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-iapVNj iUWSoH pf-104_ pf-color-scheme-1"><div style="--cw:1400px" class="sc-dExXmK cexqoG"><div class="sc-dhKdPU hjOBND pf-105_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;--s-lg:0px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-eBHgEO bnCcLn pf-106_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-kAkozD kgiAhT pf-107_ pf-heading-6-h3">Shop Attachments</h3></div></div></div><div class="sc-dhKdPU hjOBND pf-109_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-eBHgEO bnCcLn pf-110_"><div class="sc-fEiJeM qQLOw pf-111_ pf-r pf-r-ew" style="--s-xs:15px;--ew-xs:2;--ew-md:4" data-pf-type="ProductList">{% assign collection_461761937713 = collections["bcs-tractor-attachments"] %}{% assign defaultProduct = product %}{% paginate collection_461761937713.products by 12 %}{% 